coverage.summary:
Rental properties first built on or before October 1, 1978, plus replacement units under LAMC 151.28. Covered types:
- apartments and duplexes;
- two or more single-family dwellings on one parcel;
- hotel, motel, rooming or boarding house rooms occupied by the same tenant over 30 consecutive days;
- residential units attached to commercial buildings;
- ADUs and JADUs;
- mobile homes and RVs in mobile home parks.

Condominiums and townhomes are covered, but their rent is not regulated for tenancies that commenced after December 31, 1995.
